  {
   "type": "generic_update",
   "title": null,
   "role": null,
   "description": "-\n如需分享反馈，请前往[综合讨论](https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/overwatch/c/general-discussion)论坛发帖。\n\n-\n如需查看已知问题列表，请访问我们的[错误报告](https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/overwatch/c/bug-report)论坛。\n\n-\n如需故障排查帮助，请访问我们的[技术支持](https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/overwatch/c/technical-support)论坛。",
   "dev": null,
